{"id":"ed136ba4b3f727b5","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution.md","title":"System T类型代入与弱化","display":"lem-system-t-typed-substitution — System T类型代入与弱化","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution"],"display":"lem-system-t-typed-substitution — System T类型代入与弱化","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V lambda formulation print345/PDF357; full local induction on typing","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-system-t-typed-substitution — System T类型代入与弱化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a4b205829deb176\" href=\"?note=4a4b205829deb176\" title=\"72-df-system-t-typing-judgment\">72-df-system-t-typing-judgment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V lambda formulation print345/PDF357; full local induction on typing"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\">\\(\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\)</span> 是相容有限固有类型上下文，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_\\sigma\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta\">\\(x\\in V_\\sigma\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal E_T\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal E_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}\\)</span>；项代入避免捕获。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\subseteq\\Delta&#39;\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta&#39;\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\subseteq\\Delta&#39;\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta&#39;\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta,x:\\sigma\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}s:\\sigma\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t[s/x]:\\tau.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta,x:\\sigma\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}s:\\sigma\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t[s/x]:\\tau.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三式分别对类型推导归纳。变量分支按是否为x选择s或原变量；常元不变。应用使用两个归纳假设。抽象先把绑定变量改名到避开两个上下文与s的变量，利用弱化在扩展上下文中应用体的归纳假设，再作抽象。自由变量式在抽象时移除绑定者。证明使用的是有类型 System T 规则，不将无类型代入的存在自动当作类型保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-t-typing-judgment","status":"resolved","id":"4a4b205829deb176","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Delta,\\Delta'","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_\\sigma\\setminus\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathcal E_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\subseteq\\Delta'\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta'\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta,x:\\sigma\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\land\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}s:\\sigma\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t[s/x]:\\tau.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta\\vdash_T^{ty}t:\\tau\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(t)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}\\Delta.","display":true}],"bytes":1758,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitution]] · [[72-thm-system-t-closed-canonicity]] · [[72-thm-system-t-normalization]] · [[72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy]] · [[72-thm-system-t-subject-reduction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"V章新增8项：[[72-df-system-t-normal-form]] · [[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]] · [[72-df-system-t-typing-judgment]] · [[72-lem-system-t-typed-substitutio